        <item>
            <title>Version 2.7.0</title>
            <sparkle:version>2.7.0</sparkle:version>
            <pubDate>Mon, 24 Aug 2026 09:02:44 +0700</pubDate>
            <description><![CDATA[
                <h2>Remio Host for FreeBSD 2.7.0</h2>
                <p>Signing in with Google now sticks. If Remio had already seen your Google account on another device, sign-in looked like it worked but nothing was kept, so every restart asked you to sign in again. That is fixed.</p>
            ]]></description>
