            <description><![CDATA[
                <h2>Remio Host for FreeBSD 2.6.2</h2>
                <p>Fixes a screen left zoomed in too far after a phone or tablet connected — the desktop now keeps a workable size whatever device joins, and eases back toward the connecting device's preference as soon as there is room.</p>
